# Binary Block — Phase 2

Read `docs/binary-block/PHASES.md`. **Current phase: 2.**

## Phase 2 scope

Device-only progress via `localStorage` (`binary_block_progress`):

- Cleared levels
- Best Pattern Score per level
- Best time per level

Module: `games/binary-mosaic/progress/storage.ts`

## Forbidden

Firebase · Google login · ranking UI · network / `fetch` · user IDs · World Memory · Luna images / spritesheet · Phase 3+ stubs

## Do not change

Phase 1 puzzle logic · clear FX · SE/BGM · core playfield UI (unless user requests)

## Capacity

No Luna assets in the game bundle · no new npm dependencies · minimal save payload
